# 1. Copy this file to .env and paste your key after the = sign.
# 2. Load it in your terminal before you run a script:  set -a; source .env; set +a
# Get a key: https://ideogram.ai/platform -> API Keys -> Create key
# Requests need credits: add a payment method under Billing, or you get HTTP 402.
IDEOGRAM_API_KEY=
